                            <comment id="14599562" author="doanduyhai" created="Wed, 24 Jun 2015 15:17:31 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Humm, interesting, if the error is only visible when having a &lt;b&gt;remote&lt;/b&gt; Spark cluster, I guess it&apos;s related to &lt;b&gt;serialization&lt;/b&gt; issue (a hint).&lt;/p&gt;

