                            <comment id="14608126" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 30 Jun 2015 11:08:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user doanduyhai opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/133&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/133&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Fix issue raised by &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-127&quot; title=&quot;DisplayUtils breaks some spark code working &quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-127&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-127&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; related to DisplayUtils&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    To fix the issue, simple trick: &lt;b&gt;wrap the implicit value around an object and import it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    ```java&lt;br/&gt;
    intp.interpret(&quot;object MaxResult &lt;/p&gt;
{&quot; +
            &quot;implicit val sparkMaxResult = new SparkMaxResult(&quot; +
            Integer.parseInt(getProperty(&quot;zeppelin.spark.maxResult&quot;)) + &quot;)&quot; +
            &quot;}
&lt;p&gt;&quot;);&lt;br/&gt;
    intp.interpret(&quot;import MaxResult.sparkMaxResult&quot;);&lt;br/&gt;
    ```&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;You can merge this pull request into a Git repository by running:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    $ git pull &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/doanduyhai/incubator-zeppelin&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/doanduyhai/incubator-zeppelin&lt;/a&gt; FixDisplayUtils&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Alternatively you can review and apply these changes as the patch at:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/133.patch&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/133.patch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To close this pull request, make a commit to your master/trunk branch&lt;br/&gt;
with (at least) the following in the commit message:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This closes #133&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit 4ce03827577a4fdddafd80e7d62934030ed387b4&lt;br/&gt;
Author: DuyHai DOAN &amp;lt;doanduyhai@gmail.com&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Date:   2015-06-30T11:06:14Z&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Fix issue raised by &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-127&quot; title=&quot;DisplayUtils breaks some spark code working &quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-127&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-127&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; related to DisplayUtils&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14608127" author="doanduyhai" created="Tue, 30 Jun 2015 11:08:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I successfully reproduced the issue with a &lt;b&gt;separated&lt;/b&gt; Spark cluster&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12742780/12742780_IssueReproduced.png&quot; height=&quot;200&quot; width=&quot;750&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I spent a looooooooong time before figuring out the reason of this issue. It is somehow tricky and I could&apos;nt find any blog post/StackOverflow question related to it but it seems that an implicit object declared directly in the Spark REPL (used by our Spark Interpreter) is not serialized.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To fix the issue, simple trick: &lt;b&gt;wrap the implicit value around an object and import it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;intp.interpret(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;object MaxResult {&quot;&lt;/span&gt; +
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;implicit val sparkMaxResult = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; SparkMaxResult(&quot;&lt;/span&gt; +
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Integer&lt;/span&gt;.parseInt(getProperty(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;zeppelin.spark.maxResult&quot;&lt;/span&gt;)) + &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;)&quot;&lt;/span&gt; +
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;}&quot;&lt;/span&gt;);
intp.interpret(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; MaxResult.sparkMaxResult&quot;&lt;/span&gt;);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Pull request for the fix: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/133&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/133&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14611145" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 1 Jul 2015 23:04:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user Leemoonsoo commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

